EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for expressing interest in Arizona State University and becoming a Sun Devil.

Please visit our degree search at http://asu.edu/degrees to learn more about our 300+ undergraduate degree programs. You can search by interest, college, campus, or even use keywords to generate a list of programs to help find your fit at ASU.

When you click on a program, it will list the degree description, any additional admission requirements, major map (eight-semester course plan), advising contact information, career opportunities and job growth.You can also compare up to three degree programs side by side.

Please let me know if you have any questions about a specific degree program at ASU.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

